  "body": "#### Link to problem area\r\n\r\nhttps://matrix.org/docs/spec/server_server/r0.1.4#request-authentication\r\n\r\n#### Issue\r\nCame up in `#conduit:fachschaften.org`; It's not clear that the parameters after `X-Matrix` can use quotes or not, [RFC2184](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2184) was mentioned with the following quote:\r\n\r\n> Note that quotes around parameter values are part of the value\r\n> syntax; they are NOT part of the value itself.  Furthermore, it is\r\n> explicitly permitted to have a mixture of quoted and unquoted\r\n> continuation fields.\r\n\r\nMaybe this clarification can be added as an informational footnote.",
